OL,3,GNEWSACouncil drops plans for new town
OL,4,Aprimary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new 420-place primary
OL,7,Fschool on the southern edge of
OL,8,FLoughborough have been dropped.
OL,10,FLeicestershire County Council had said
OL,11,Fthe school should be built as part of a
OL,12,Fproposed housing development off Terry
OL,13,FYardley Way, near Woodthorpe.
OL,15,FHowever, the Reform UK-run authority
OL,16,Fhas now removed the school from its
OL,17,Flong-term planning after a review
OL,18,Fconcluded pupil numbers in the area
OL,19,Fwould fall over the next 15 years.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
