OL,3,GNEWSACouncil drops plans for new town
OL,4,Aprimary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school was expected to have cost
OL,7,Fabout #14m to build, though the
OL,8,Fauthority said it had not yet committed
OL,9,Fany funding to it.
